+Moving a member removes them from `{pid}`, adds them to the target with the same
+role, and unassigns their tasks in `{pid}`. The caller must be a manager of both
+projects (403 otherwise); unreadable target → 404, same project → 400, archived
+source or target → 409, user already in the target → 409.
 
